recommend keep-going Ledger Voice r4 — read a real ledger true (an @embedFile-bound fixture, folded supply cross-checked against an independent awk reading, two tools one answer), closing the arc. Quorum-served readings + breach renames (cairn-first) + deep debride + seed force-push stay Keaton's hand.
